Package: MigraineEmaxSim
Type: Package
Title: Readable Bayesian Migraine Analysis and Development Simulations
Version: 0.5.3
Authors@R: person("Analysis", "Maintainer", email = "maintainer@example.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A four-stage workflow for elicited-prior calibration, a constrained
    historical meta-analysis in Stan, a drug-specific Emax update in Stan,
    and simulations of direct and staged development programs. Phase 2 and
    Phase 3 have separate, commented functions. Multiple contrast testing uses
    DoseFinding. All changes and treatment effects are negative for improvement.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: dplyr (>= 1.0.0), tidyr (>= 1.1.0), purrr (>= 1.0.0),
    tibble, readr, ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), DoseFinding (>= 1.0.0), posterior,
    stats, utils
Suggests: cmdstanr
Additional_repositories: https://stan-dev.r-universe.dev
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
